<h2 id="start-this-month">How to make money in Denver this month</h2>
<ol class="steps">
  <li><strong>Pick one hustle that matches the season.</strong> Fall is for leaf cleanup and ski tuning prep, winter for snow and delivery, spring for detailing and yard work, summer for events and dog hiking.</li>
